### Phase 13: Saga, idempotency, transactional outbox.
### Tokens:  ./infrastructure/keycloak/pkce-login.sh <alice|sam> 2>/dev/null
### Kafka down (nothing lost):  docker stop banking-kafka   ...   docker start banking-kafka
### Make a debit hang (lock Alice's account row for 12 s):
###   docker exec banking-postgres psql -U <admin> -d account_db \
###     -c "BEGIN; SELECT id FROM accounts WHERE id = '<alice-account>' FOR UPDATE; SELECT pg_sleep(12); ROLLBACK;" &

@gw = http://localhost:8080
@alice = paste-alice-token
@sam = paste-sam-token
@aliceAccount = paste-an-alice-account-id
@bobsNumber = paste-a-bob-account-number
@key = 6f1c2b8e-4a1d-4c7e-9a55-0d2f3e4b5a61

### 1. A transfer with an Idempotency-Key → 201 COMPLETED
POST {{gw}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{aliceAccount}}", "targetAccountNumber": "{{bobsNumber}}", "amount": 10.00, "description": "rent" }

### 2. Exactly the same again (a retry) → 201, SAME payment id, header Idempotent-Replayed: true, no money moved
POST {{gw}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{aliceAccount}}", "targetAccountNumber": "{{bobsNumber}}", "amount": 10.00, "description": "rent" }

### 3. Same key, different amount → 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED (nothing executed)
POST {{gw}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{aliceAccount}}", "targetAccountNumber": "{{bobsNumber}}", "amount": 99.00, "description": "rent" }

### 4. Malformed key → 400
POST {{gw}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: short

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{aliceAccount}}", "targetAccountNumber": "{{bobsNumber}}", "amount": 1.00 }

### 5. Poll a payment that answered 202 (PENDING / DEBITED / COMPENSATING): the recovery job finishes it
GET {{gw}}/api/payments/paste-a-payment-id
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 6. Back office: payments still in progress, and the ones automation handed over to people
GET {{gw}}/api/admin/payments?status=DEBITED
Authorization: Bearer {{sam}}

###
GET {{gw}}/api/admin/payments?status=NEEDS_RECONCILIATION
Authorization: Bearer {{sam}}

### 7. Statement: events made while Kafka was down appear once it's back (outbox relay)
GET {{gw}}/api/transactions?accountId={{aliceAccount}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
